  "reflectionText": "Paul wrote: be strong in the Lord and in the strength of his might. Put on the whole armor of God: the belt of truth, the breastplate of righteousness, the shield of faith, the helmet of salvation, the sword of the Spirit. What is it to dress in armor for a battle that is not against flesh and blood, in a place where no one watching can see your enemy?"
